<title>USA: Bell Atlantic Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.14		    $1.05</p>
<p> Net			498,900		  463,700</p>
<p> Oper Revs	    3,440,700		3,223,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 439,500		  439,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 net includes charge of $0.03 per share for writedown of CAI Wireless Systems Inc investment.</p>
<p>Q2 network services revenues, excluding other services, were $3.37 billion vs $3.19 billion.  </p>
<p>SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.31		    $2.11</p>
<p> Net		    1,014,500		1,070,500</p>
<p> Oper Revs	    6,854,600		6,443,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 439,700		  439,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1736))</p>
